he job row renders the runtime \"Failed\" treatment.\n- Given `message_code` is ambiguous or absent for a failed job, then the job row falls back to a single \"Failed\" state with `status.message` text displayed as supplementary detail.\n- The new visual treatments are reviewed against the UXD state icon/color specifications.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- [P2] Pre-start vs. runtime failure distinction using `status.message.message_code` where available\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":74594,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-854fba31643c93bf","agent_id":"a60c1c46c7da11595","session_id":"6801b43c-a805-4fcb-88e0-698d74311470","uuid":"e6921bc0-5e48-4ddb-bf0d-bdcfcbe54b5e","timestamp":"2026-10-22T04:54:49.130Z","subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-8005"}
